The Lojban MOO, aka samxarmuj, is now ready for people to actually
use it.

It is *far* from feature complete, and definately not yet ready for
xartum work, but it's very useable at this point.

Information on how to get on is at
http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-index.php?page=The%20Lojban%20MOO&bl

That information is probably woefully incomplete; please send me any
ideas you have on how to improve it, preferrably with lots of stuff
written up that I can just cut and paste in, or edit it yourself.

Man, it's been a *lot* of work to get this far.  Phew.

-Robin

